  <item>
    <title>vol.05【串台】《姐姐说》别笑！我是个演员</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62db84e0fa15142e17251eb0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62db84e0fa15142e17251eb0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 23 Jul 2022 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>感谢美丽姐的邀请，在《姐姐说》完成了人生第一次串台体验，超级开心～！</span></p><span></span><p><span>两位姐姐，美丽和六月完美诠释什么是潇洒治愈从容美丽，吾辈楷模～希望以后有机会，可以一起探索更多关于生活，关于女性，关于成长的话题～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期回忆关于昊蓝的演艺经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一夜之间变成公众人物，被骂上热搜是什么体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何从主持人到演员，撕下标签？</span></p><span></span><p><span>5年时间，经历变形、失真，膨胀又慢慢归于平静。</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢大家，愿意听我讲这不算精彩离奇，只觉一点荒诞的小故事～</span></p><span></span><p><span>搞笑女？nonono。大家好，我是演员陈昊蓝。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期鸣谢：</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：六月、美丽</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：陈昊蓝</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：美丽、小谢</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：Will</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Louis Armstrong-The Bare Necessities</span></p><span></span><p><span>Stevie Wonder-Isn't She Lovely</span></p><span></span><p><span>Randy Newman - You've Got a Friend in Me</span></p><span></span><p><span>La La Land Cast - Another Day Of Sun</span></p><span></span><p><span>Robbie Williams - Beyond the Sea</span></p><span></span><p><span>Enjoy Music Club - ナイトランデブー</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lstjTndhpAgYqlSEz_JAlYE0aW2i.m4a" length="117933553" type="audio/mp4"/>
